(191, 3, '0', 1, 8, '[]', NULL, NULL, '<!--?xml encoding=\"UTF-8\"--><p><a id=\"_Hlk190251568\"></a><strong>Sura and Baya</strong></p><p> Along time ago, there were two animals, Sura and Baya. Sura was the name of a shark and Baya was a crocodile. They lived in a sea. (<em>Paragraph 1</em>)</p><p>One day, Sura went to the land and looked for some food in the river. He was very hungry and there was not much food in the sea. Baya was very angry when he knew that Sura broke the promise. (<em>Paragraph 2</em>)</p><p>Feeling tired of fighting, they lived in the different places. Sura lived in the water and Baya lived in the land. The border was the beach, so they would never fight again. (<em>Paragraph 3</em>)</p><p>Once Sura and Baya were looking for some food. Suddenly, Baya saw a goat.</p><p>\"Yummy, this is my lunch,\" said Baya. </p><p>\"No way! This is my lunch. You are greedy,” said Sura. Then they fought for the goat. After several hours, they were very tired. (<em>Paragraph 4</em>)</p><p>Which of the following arrangement paragraphs shows the correct order of the text?</p>\n', '<!--?xml encoding=\"UTF-8\"--><p>1 – 2 – 3 – 4 </p>\n', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1772543164, 1772543164, 1, '', 8, '0', '0'),
(192, 3, '0', 1, 9, '[]', NULL, NULL, '<!--?xml encoding=\"UTF-8\"--><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y7CC988vRk8\"><em>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y7CC988vRk8</em></a></p><p>Which of the following best describes the overall aesthetic of this house?</p>\n', '<!--?xml encoding=\"UTF-8\"--><p>Rustic and Traditional</p>\n', '', '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1772543164, 1772543164, 1, '', 8, '0', '0'),
