if&quot;\">Mengembangkandemokrasi politik.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.15pt;mso-list:l1 level4 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">2.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Mengaktifkanmasyarakat sipil dalam arena politik.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.15pt;mso-list:l1 level4 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">3.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Menjalinkedekatan dalam hubungan bilateral dengan Negara lain.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.15pt;mso-list:l1 level4 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">4.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Memperkuatkepercayaan rakyat dengan menegakkan pemerintahan yang bersih dan berwibawa.</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:1.0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:-14.15pt;mso-list:l1 level4 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">5.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></spa