 anggota DPR</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:IN\"></span></p>\n', '<!--?xml encoding=\"UTF-8\"--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:IN\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> </span></span></span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#221F1F;mso-font-width:105%;mso-ansi-language:IN\">Presiden<span style=\"letter-spacing:.85pt\"> </span>melalui<span style=\"letter-spacing:.9pt\"> </span>para<span style=\"letter-spacing:.85pt\"> </span>menterinya<span style=\"letter-spacing:.85pt\"> </span>membuat<span style=\"letter-spacing:.85pt\"></span>kebijakan<span style=\"letter-spacing:.85pt\"> </span>atau<span style=\"letter-spacing:.9pt\"> </span>peraturan tanpa melibatkan anggota DPR</span>\n', '<!--?xml encoding=\"UTF-8\"--><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#221F1F;letter-spacing:.1pt;mso-ansi-language:IN\">Presiden</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#221F1F;letter-spacing:2.5pt;mso-ansi-language:IN\"> </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#221F1F;letter-spacing:.1pt;mso-ansi-language:IN\">membuat</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#221F1F;letter-spacing:2.5pt;mso-ansi-language:IN\"> </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#221F1F;letter-spacing:.1pt;mso-ansi-language:IN\">kebijakan</span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#221F1F;letter-spacing:2.5pt;mso-ansi-language:IN\"> </span><span lang=\"IN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roma